**When to use:** Use when auditing slow page loads, heavy assets, or rendering delays related to Show loading indicators. Verify the actual bottleneck in DevTools, Lighthouse, or field data before recommending changes.

### Show loading indicators

Loading indicators reassure users that something is happening—without feedback, users may think the page is broken or click repeatedly, degrading experience and causing duplicate actions.

