##### Element Reference

| Element | Required | Values |
|---------|----------|--------|
| `<loc>` | Yes | Absolute URL, max 2048 chars |
| `<lastmod>` | No | W3C Datetime format (e.g., `2025-03-01`) |
| `<changefreq>` | No | `always`, `hourly`, `daily`, `weekly`, `monthly`, `yearly`, `never` |
| `<priority>` | No | `0.0` to `1.0` (default: `0.5`) |

