| Radix | Base UI |
| --- | --- |
| Scrollbar `[data-state="visible" \| "hidden"]` | Dropped. Use `[data-hovering]`, `[data-scrolling]`, and `[data-has-overflow-x/y]` on Scrollbar to drive visibility styles. |
